# Issue: #404
# Date: 2026-09-18
# Status: Approved
# Author: NMG

Feature: Restrict drafted issues and specs to executable software requirements

  @SCN404-AC1
  Scenario: Classify content against actual execute authority
    Given a candidate issue or spec statement
    When draft-issue or write-spec evaluates whether to retain it
    Then it retains the statement only when implement or fix can realize it through permitted repository changes
    And verify can prove it through observable local, registered-provider, or qualified PR-only evidence
    And lifecycle work remains control-plane metadata rather than a functional requirement

  @SCN404-AC2
  Scenario: Preserve only executable behavior from mixed input
    Given source material combines executable software behavior with externally owned obligations
    When draft-issue or write-spec synthesizes generated artifacts
    Then it retains the software behavior and testable technical constraints
    And it omits each external obligation, rationale, citation, proof, sign-off, operation, and attestation

  @SCN404-AC3
  Scenario: Do not relocate excluded content
    Given source material contains an obligation that execute cannot implement and verify
    When either workflow filters the source
    Then the obligation is absent from contextual, boundary, design, task, and scenario sections
    And Out of Scope contains only adjacent software behavior

  @SCN404-AC4
  Scenario: Stop when no executable requirement remains
    Given filtering leaves no executable software behavior
    When either workflow reaches synthesis
    Then it emits its exact execute-named diagnostic
    And it stops before plan creation, proposal, repository mutation, or GitHub mutation

  @SCN404-AC5
  Scenario: Render one shared capability contract for both commands
    Given the extension renders an interactive command prompt
    When the consumer is draft-issue or write-spec
    Then the same plugin-owned execute capability contract follows the workflow body
    And project steering follows without broadening publication authority

  @SCN404-AC6
  Scenario: Audit the complete generated payload
    Given eligible source material remains
    When synthesis is complete
    Then draft-issue audits the complete issue body before proposal
    And write-spec audits all four complete spec files before proposal
    And the local plan records feasibility for every acceptance criterion, functional requirement, task, and scenario
    And generated issue and spec content excludes the feasibility ledger and unresolved material choices
